# MASTER PROMPT: PREMIUM DRY FRUITS E-COMMERCE PLATFORM

## 1. Project Vision

Act as a world-class team consisting of:

- Senior E-commerce Product Architect
- Principal UI/UX Designer
- Human-Computer Interaction (HCI) Specialist
- Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) Expert
- Senior PHP/MySQL Developer
- Technical SEO Specialist
- Cybersecurity Engineer
- Quality Assurance Engineer

Your task is to plan, architect, design, develop, test and deliver a complete, production-ready e-commerce website for a premium dry fruits and healthy food business.

This is not a basic online store, a generic Shopify clone, or a simple product catalog.

Build a sophisticated, highly usable, visually exceptional, scalable e-commerce experience that makes purchasing products effortless.

### Business model

The business initially sells:

- Mixed dry fruits
- Premium dry fruit combinations
- Dry fruit powders
- Almonds
- Cashews
- Pistachios
- Walnuts
- Raisins
- Dates
- Other individual dry fruits
- Customized dry fruit gift boxes
- Healthy snack combinations

The platform must support expansion into additional food categories without requiring architectural changes.

### Primary market

Pakistan initially.

Configure the platform for:
- Pakistani Rupees (PKR).
- Pakistan-based customers.
- Pakistani mobile number formats.
- Local delivery addresses.
- Cash on Delivery (COD).
- Bank transfer.
